OL,3,GNEWSAGetting mayor in Lancashire a
OL,4,A'priority for PM'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecuring an elected mayor for
OL,7,FLancashire is "a priority" for the
OL,8,FPrime Minister and could come with a
OL,9,F#1bn funding commitment, council
OL,10,Fleaders have been told.
OL,12,FDevolution minister Jim McMahon told
OL,13,Fthe Lancashire Combine County Authority
OL,14,F(LCCA) "getting Lancashire into mayoral
OL,15,Fdevolution was a priority" for both him
OL,16,Fand Andy Burnham.
OL,18,FThe leaders of Lancashire County
OL,19,FCouncil, Blackpool Council and
OL,20,FBlackburn with Darwen Council, which
OL,21,Fmake up the LCCA, said they would
OL,22,Fconsider what the minister had said.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
