OL,3,GNEWSAGetting mayor in Lancashire a
OL,4,A'priority for PM'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire, which would not hold
OL,7,Felections for a mayor until 2028, will
OL,8,Fsoon be the only place in the north of
OL,9,FEngland not to have one.
